格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 插件：让 agent 默认用中文思考与回复（移植自 superpowers-zh）","id":"gh:1334615244","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-chinese-thinking","slug":"GongYuanCaiJi/dsh-chinese-thinking","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 插件：让 agent 默认用中文思考与回复（移植自 superpowers-zh）"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-chinese-thinking · 中文思考预设"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"🌐 **简体中文** | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**让 DeepSeek Harness 的 agent 默认用中文思考、用中文回复。**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Makes your DeepSeek Harness agent think and answer in Chinese by default.**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 功能 / Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **默认中文**：不指定语言时，agent 用中文思考、用中文输出；代码、命令、专有名词保留英文原文\n- **中文排版规范**：中英文空格、全角标点、数字与单位、括号引号 —— 逐字移植自 sup"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"erpowers-zh 的 chinese-documentation\n- **中英混排最佳实践**：术语保留与翻译、首次出现标注、避免过度翻译\n- **代码注释语言**：何时用中文 / 何时用英文（"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"chinese-code-review）\n- **中文提交规范**：type 保留英文、scope/description/body 用中文（chinese-commit-conventions）\n-"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" **国内 Git 工作流**：核心原则（chinese-git-workflow）"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 效果 / What it does"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"安装后，agent 的 system prompt 会多出「中文思考」一节：你在对话里用中文，它就全程用中文想、用中文答 —— 不再「聊着聊着吐英文」。这一节是**可配置的预设**：改 `config"},{"id":"p9s2","text":".text` 就能换成你自己的中文思考指令。"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 安装 / Installation"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"本插件尚未发布到 npm（`dsh-chinese-thinking` 这个名字已验证可注册），目前用本地路径安装。先克隆本仓库，再在仓库根目录执行："},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"装完重启 dsh，开一段新对话即可生效。"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 配置 / Configuration"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"默认配置（`cordis.patch.yml` 里的 `config: {}` 走 schema 默认值）："},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| 键 | 默认 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| `enabled` | `true` | 是否注入「中文思考」system prompt 节 |\n| `order` | `60` | 节的顺序（-100 身份、0 persona、100–199"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" 工具指引） |\n| `text` | 见 `prompt.js` | 提示词正文，可整体覆盖 |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"覆盖示例（写在你自己 profile 的 `cordis.patch.yml`，patch 会整体替换该行的 config）："},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 移植来源 / Upstream"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"本插件是 **superpowers-zh**（MIT，9k+ 下载/月，7.6k★）的移植（port）。提示词正文逐字来自其 `chinese-documentation`、`chinese-cod"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"e-review`、`chinese-commit-conventions`、`chinese-git-workflow` 与 `using-superpowers` 五个 skill 正文，源文件 "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"SHA-256 已钉在 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md，可自行核验。"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- 上游仓库：jnMetaCode/superpowers-zh\n- 上游 npm：superpowers-zh\n- 上游基线：obra/superpowers"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"如果你觉得有用，**请也给上游 superpowers-zh 一个 star** ⭐"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT。见 LICENSE 与 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md。"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"授权/合规询问 → GitHub issues"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"# dsh-chinese-thinking · Chinese Thinking Default"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"🌐 简体中文 | **English**"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"**Makes your DeepSeek Harness agent think and answer in Chinese by default.**"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- **Chinese by default**: when no language is specified, the agent thinks and answers in Chinese; co"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"de, commands, and proper nouns stay in English\n- **Chinese typography rules**: spacing between CJK/L"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"atin, full-width punctuation, numbers & units, brackets and quotes — verbatim from superpowers-zh's "},{"id":"p31s4","text":"`chinese-documentation`\n- **Bilingual writing best practices**: which terms to keep in English vs. t"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"ranslate, first-mention annotations, avoiding over-translation\n- **Code comment language**: when to "},{"id":"p31s6","text":"use Chinese vs. English (`chinese-code-review`)\n- **Chinese commit conventions**: English `type`, Ch"},{"id":"p31s7","text":"inese scope/description/body (`chinese-commit-conventions`)\n- **Domestic Git workflow**: core princi"},{"id":"p31s8","text":"ple (`chinese-git-workflow`)"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"After installation, a \"Chinese Thinking\" section is added to the agent's system prompt: once you cha"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"t in Chinese, the agent thinks and answers in Chinese end to end — no more drifting into English mid"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"-conversation. The section is a **configurable preset**: override `config.text` to ship your own Chi"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"nese-thinking instructions."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"This plugin is not published to npm yet (the name `dsh-chinese-thinking` is verified available), so "},{"id":"p35s2","text":"install from a local path. Clone this repo first, then run from the repo root:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Restart dsh and start a new conversation to activate."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Defaults (the `config: {}` in `cordis.patch.yml` resolves to schema defaults):"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Key | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| `enabled` | `true` | Whether to inject the \"Chinese Thinking\" system-prompt section |\n| `order` | "},{"id":"p41s2","text":"`60` | Section order (-100 identity, 0 persona, 100–199 tool guidance) |\n| `text` | see `prompt.js` "},{"id":"p41s3","text":"| The prompt body; replace wholesale to customize |"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Override example (in your profile's own `cordis.patch.yml` — a patch replaces the row's entire confi"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"rride example (in your profile's own `cordis.patch.yml` — a patch replaces the row's entire config):"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Upstream"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"This plugin is a **port** of **superpowers-zh** (MIT, 9k+ downloads/month, 7.6k★). The prompt body i"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"s copied verbatim from its `chinese-documentation`, `chinese-code-review`, `chinese-commit-conventio"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"ns`, `chinese-git-workflow`, and `using-superpowers` skill bodies; source SHA-256 hashes are pinned "},{"id":"p45s4","text":"in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for self-verification."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"- Upstream repo: jnMetaCode/superpowers-zh\n- Upstream npm: superpowers-zh\n- Upstream baseline: obra/"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"repo: jnMetaCode/superpowers-zh\n- Upstream npm: superpowers-zh\n- Upstream baseline: obra/superpowers"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"If you find this useful, **please star the upstream superpowers-zh too** ⭐"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"MIT. See LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md."},{"id":"p50s1","text":"License/compliance inquiries → GitHub issues"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
